## Rencana Database (Migrations)

### 1. [NEW] `create_goods_receipts_table`
Menyimpan data header penerimaan barang.
*   `id` (Primary Key)
*   `nomor_gr` (string 50, unique) - Nomor transaksi penerimaan (contoh: `GR/2026/07/0001`)
*   `tanggal_gr` (date) - Tanggal barang diterima
*   `po_id` (foreignId ke `purchase_orders`) - PO asal
*   `gudang_id` (foreignId ke `master_gudang`) - Gudang penyimpanan
*   `nomor_surat_jalan` (string 100, nullable) - No. Surat Jalan supplier
*   `keterangan` (text, nullable) - Catatan tambahan
*   `created_by` (foreignId ke `users`, audit trail)
*   `updated_by` (foreignId ke `users`, nullable)
*   `deleted_by` (foreignId ke `users`, nullable)
*   `timestamps` & `softDeletes`

### 2. [NEW] `create_goods_receipt_details_table`
Menyimpan baris item yang diterima.
*   `id` (Primary Key)
*   `gr_id` (foreignId ke `goods_receipts` cascade)
*   `po_detail_id` (foreignId ke `purchase_order_details` cascade) - Baris item PO asal
*   `barang_id` (foreignId ke `master_barang` cascade)
*   `jumlah` (decimal 12,2) - Kuantitas diterima
*   `timestamps`

### 3. [NEW] `create_stok_gudangs_table`
Menyimpan saldo akumulasi stok aktual barang di setiap gudang.
*   `id` (Primary Key)
*   `barang_id` (foreignId ke `master_barang` cascade)
*   `gudang_id` (foreignId ke `master_gudang` cascade)
*   `stok_aktual` (decimal 12,2, default 0)
*   *Unique Composite Index:* `[barang_id, gudang_id]`
*   `timestamps`

### 4. [NEW] `create_kartu_stoks_table`
Audit log pergerakan keluar masuk stok (mutasi stok).
*   `id` (Primary Key)
*   `barang_id` (foreignId ke `master_barang` cascade)
*   `gudang_id` (foreignId ke `master_gudang` cascade)
*   `tipe` (enum: `Masuk`, `Keluar`)
*   `jumlah` (decimal 12,2) - Qty mutasi
*   `stok_awal` (decimal 12,2) - Saldo sebelum mutasi
*   `stok_akhir` (decimal 12,2) - Saldo setelah mutasi
*   `referensi_jenis` (string 100) - Jenis dokumen asal (e.g. `Goods Receipt`, `Goods Receipt Deletion`)
*   `referensi_id` (unsignedBigInteger) - ID dokumen terkait
*   `referensi_nomor` (string 100) - Nomor dokumen terkait (e.g. `GR/2026/07/0001`)
*   `keterangan` (text, nullable)
*   `created_at` (timestamp)

